      "created_at": "2018-04-13T01:23:52Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-04-13T01:23:52Z",
      "body": "I've got a few early stage ideas on how to improve the product:\r\n\r\n * Allow batch deletion of user form submissions (data minimisation)\r\n * Add instructions to userforms CMS UI about collecting personal data\r\n * Collect consent for existing users on login\r\n * Clear out IPs from Login Attempt tables\r\n * Delete login attempts with email/IP when deleting user\r\n\r\nFor now, I've sent a docs PR at https://github.com/silverstripe/silverstripe-framework/pull/8003",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "pin": null,
