      "created_at": "2019-10-21T05:22:55Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-10-21T05:22:55Z",
      "body": "> Given that most people use Google Anaytics or similar one thing that you may want to include is that the LostPasswordHandler by default redirects to a URL that contains the users email address which is PII and will end up in Analytics software\r\n\r\nJust following up on this, that's been resolved for a while through https://github.com/silverstripe/silverstripe-framework/commit/560fe9820a51eb3001dafdc1e34806434392a3e3#diff-a01f0c31fe0157e58576a47bffd12adc.\r\n\r\nI can't see any specific action left on this ticket, closing. ",
